<title>UK: Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt sets calls on German firms.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt sets calls on German firms.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt KGaA Dusseldorf said it has issued 90 million American-style call warrants, in 18 equal tranches, on various German companies.</p>
<p>There are two tranches on BASF AG, one tranche on Bayer AG, three tranches on Daimler-Benz AG, two tranches on Deutsche Bank AG, two tranches on Hoechst AG, two tranches on Mannesmann AG, one tranche on RWE AG, two tranches on VEBA AG and three tranches on Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 10.FEB.97-14.NOV.97   PAYDATE	10.FEB.97</p>
<p>LISTING	   DUSS, FFURT, STUTT    MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
